Assuming you have a blessed unicorn horn, you actually don't need ANY
of these right away - or at all.

You should really have a fully identified wand of fire for permanently
burning Elbereth.

You mentioned that you have 'a couple' of magic markers - good, but
what are their charges?  How many blank scrolls and scrolls of
charging do you have?  Have you identified the scroll of genocide yet?

The best way to proceed depends on which conducts you are planning on
keeping.  If you are playing vegan, polypile-less. polyself-less and
weaponless, the strategy is very different than if you are not keeping
those conducts.

The most 'powerful' weapon in the game is the 'stoning grenade' - a
cockatrice egg.  If you are not playing polyself-less, it would pay to
aquire polycontrol and a big pile of food, and then attempt to collect
about 50-80 cockatrice eggs and put them in your BoH.

If you are not opposed to exploiting known bugs, you can take
advantage of the lifesaved-polself bug to boost your HP and Pw up into
the hundreds of thousands.

If you are not playing vegetarian, you can reverse-genocide mind
flayers to boost up your INT, and then use the Eye to portal a bunch
of wraiths(and yourself) from the VotDead into sokoban to boost your
level and Pw.

You will also want teleport control soon.

